        <p>A rnefitinz of thig Cornrnitr,ee was held in t `le Bard Room at the Workhouse on Friday. Mr. G. Pilling pre- sided,and therm cr,-,rA also present :—Messrs. A. J. Jolley, A. Jolley, S. D ivies, J. Cl4rke, E. I, Bent, T. Halton, J. Billinge, William Houghton, with Mr. J. C. Sutton (clerk). Mr- S. Sutt-ni (assiita at clerk), Mr. S. 0 wen (as istant valuer), Mr. J. Smith (for Mr. Tunstall assist- ant overseer), Mr. Wii4ht and Mr. Brimelow (assistant overseers). .</p>
