        <p>The switching applratus of the gre&amp;teleCtricity works of Gls City of Geneva situated on the Rhone. near Chevres, caught fire last night, and in a short time the entire ~orks wer.! deAroverl. RESULT OF VIE NORTa DOWN ELECTION.</p>
        <p>The vo.es rec ,rled at the election in North Dawn on Wedneslay to fill up the vacancy caused by the death ot Colonel Waring (C) were counted yesterday,with the fol.owing result J. BL AKIS lON-HOUSTON (C) 3,381 T. L. CORBETI (I C)... 3.101</p>
